  "student_passage": "Sam: (1) ____\nJill: To the new aquarium beside the river.\nSam: (2) ____\nJill: My cousins, Emma and Jack. They like sea animals too.\nSam: (3) ____\nJill: By underground. The Blue Line stops near the door.\nSam: (4) ____\nJill: At half past eight. The journey takes about thirty minutes.\nSam: (5) ____\nJill: Sharks and sea turtles. We want to watch the animals, but we won't touch them.\n\n共享句子：\nA. Who is coming with you?\nB. How are you getting there?\nC. What are you going to see?\nD. What time will you leave?\nE. Where are you going on Sunday?\nF. Why did you stay at home?",
